{%- capture subject -%}Your bank asks you to confirm a payment: {{ invoice.number }}{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture html -%}
<p>Hello{% if customer.name %} {{ customer.name }}{% endif %},</p>
<p>Your bank asks you to confirm (3D Secure) the payment of {{ invoice.amount }} for invoice {{ invoice.number }}. You can confirm it on the page below.</p>
{% if invoice.hosted_url %}<p><a href="{{ invoice.hosted_url }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 18px;background:#111827;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Confirm the payment</a></p>{% endif %}
<p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:13px;">You receive this email because of your subscription or invoice with {{ merchant.name }}.</p>
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture text -%}
Hello{% if customer.name %} {{ customer.name }}{% endif %},

Your bank asks you to confirm (3D Secure) the payment of {{ invoice.amount }} for invoice {{ invoice.number }}. You can confirm it here: {{ invoice.hosted_url }}

You receive this email because of your subscription or invoice with {{ merchant.name }}.
{%- endcapture -%}
